Z||000052||Cheever3000||09-25-2001||11:29 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>sorry PFF<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>What you do, see, is when you notice something in your post that needs changed, you click on that little icon at the top of your post - the icon with a pencil.  That brings up the post like it was before you submitted it, and you can make all the changes you want, then submit it again.  Only this time it doesn't create a new post, it just changes the one you already submitted.<P>"Ya folla?" - Robert Shaw, <I>The Sting</I><P><BR>||||reg||1
